# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Design handoff bundle — NEVER COMMIT.
# `new aq website/.../uploads/` contains members_rows.csv: a 1,370-row export
# of the live members table including email, phone, google_id and auth_uid,
# for a membership that is largely minors. The .dc.html canvases in the same
# bundle were built from those exports and may embed real names.
#
# This repo has already had member PII pushed into its history once
# (2,360 emails/phones). Do not add more. The bundle is an INPUT artifact:
# it lives on disk and in Claude Design, and the product does not build from it.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
new aq website/
